{
  "declaredLength": 2852,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n能在这里遇到你真是巧了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A80FD57288FD991CC904752304F60771F662F5DE74E863002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下来我要谈生意，\n欢迎你参观。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B6765621189818C08751F610FFF0C000A6B228FCE4F6053C289C23002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久等了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E457B494E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我们闲话少说，\n马上开始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114EEC95F28BDD5C118BF4FF0C000A9A6C4E0A5F0059CB5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "关于异次元密阿雷的调查费用，\n阔星公司负担的金额是不是太少了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51734E8E5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848C0367E58D397528FF0C000A9614661F516C53F88D1F62C5768491D1989D662F4E0D662F592A5C114E86FF1F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是一开始就决定好的，\n而且我们也提供了器材之类的设备。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F4E005F0059CB5C3151B35B9A597D7684FF0C000A800C4E1462114EEC4E5F63D04F9B4E86566867504E4B7C7B76848BBE59073002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另外，在器材的研发上\n我们也投了不少钱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E65916FF0C5728566867507684781453D14E0A000A62114EEC4E5F62954E864E0D5C1194B13002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这些事我们很清楚。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是，调查对象太多，\n我们出动的人数超出了预料。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E9B4E8B62114EEC5F886E05695A300200100001BE01000A4F46662FFF0C8C0367E55BF98C61592A591AFF0C000A62114EEC51FA52A876844EBA65708D8551FA4E8698846599300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人在工作后会精疲力尽。\n慰劳他们的方式之一就是钱，对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA57285DE54F5C540E4F1A7CBE75B2529B5C3D3002000A617052B34ED64EEC768465B95F0F4E4B4E005C31662F94B1FF0C5BF95427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但现在要改变预算的话，需要上报申请。\n这个过程也会花很多时间。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4673B057288981653953D898847B9776848BDDFF0C970089814E0A62A575338BF73002000A8FD94E2A8FC77A0B4E5F4F1A82B15F88591A65F695F43002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这一点我们也很清楚。\n毕竟贵公司是担任都市开发的大企业。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E0070B962114EEC4E5F5F886E05695A3002000A6BD57ADF8D35516C53F8662F62C54EFB90FD5E025F0053D1768459274F014E1A300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但你应该很清楚，做好调查\n对你们的都市开发事业也很重要。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464F605E948BE55F886E05695AFF0C505A597D8C0367E5000A5BF94F604EEC768490FD5E025F0053D14E8B4E1A4E5F5F8891CD8981300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我们彼此都在为这座城市行动，\n但这样下去会没完没了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662114EEC5F7C6B6490FD57284E3A8FD95EA757CE5E02884C52A8FF0C000A4F468FD968374E0B53BB4F1A6CA15B8C6CA14E865440300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……既然如此，\n用宝可梦对战来决定如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202665E2713659826B64FF0C000A75285B9D53EF68A65BF96218676551B35B9A59824F55FF1F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请让我选择<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n来当这场较量的商业合作伙伴。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE9898300200100001BE01000A8BF78BA96211900962E90010000201000000000A67655F538FD9573A8F8391CF768455464E1A54084F5C4F194F343002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590534E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是在谈生意。\n不能让乌羽久等。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F57288C08751F610F3002000A4E0D80FD8BA94E4C7FBD4E457B493002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这也是我不能让步的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E5F662F62114E0D80FD8BA96B657684573065B93002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了和马斯卡托决出高下，\n只能打宝可梦对战才行呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86548C9A6C65AF5361625851B351FA9AD84E0BFF0C000A53EA80FD62535B9D53EF68A65BF96218624D884C5440FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这也是为了维护乌羽先生的面子，\n我要全力击退二位。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E5F662F4E3A4E867EF462A44E4C7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A621189815168529B51FB90004E8C4F4D300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来速战速决吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765901F6218901F51B35427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人是不会因为对方\n只会说漂亮话而行动的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA662F4E0D4F1A56E04E3A5BF965B9000A53EA4F1A8BF46F024EAE8BDD800C884C52A87684FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能让人们心甘情愿地工作，\n这也是我们锈蚀组的自豪之处。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD8BA94EBA4EEC5FC3751860C5613F57305DE54F5CFF0C000A8FD94E5F662F62114EEC950886807EC4768481EA8C6A4E4B5904300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这事也关乎乌羽先生的面子，\n所以我绝对不会手下留情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E8B4E5F51734E4E4E4C7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A62404EE562117EDD5BF94E0D4F1A624B4E0B755960C5300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "别让乌羽他们久等，\n赶快开始宝可梦对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522B8BA94E4C7FBD4ED64EEC4E457B49FF0C000A8D765FEB5F0059CB5B9D53EF68A65BF9621854273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蜈蚣王！有你并肩作战的话，\n即使是这种局面，我也能笑着渡过！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "870886A3738BFF0167094F605E7680A94F5C621876848BDDFF0C000A53734F7F662F8FD979CD5C409762FF0C62114E5F80FD7B1177406E218FC7FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让你见识一下由超级进化产生的纽带……\n会让盔甲鸟变得多美吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94F6089C18BC64E004E0B75318D857EA78FDB53164EA7751F76847EBD5E2620262026000A4F1A8BA976D475329E1F53D85F97591A7F8E5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老翁龙和我心心相印！\n就让你见识一下超级进化真正的力量吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80017FC19F99548C62115FC35FC376F85370FF01000A5C318BA94F6089C18BC64E004E0B8D857EA78FDB5316771F6B637684529B91CF54273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你果然厉害。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果不是和你并肩作战的话，\n输的人就是我了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4F60679C713653895BB3300200100001BE01000A5982679C4E0D662F548C4F605E7680A94F5C621876848BDDFF0C000A8F9376844EBA5C31662F62114E863002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "输了就是输了！\n调查费用就先这样吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F934E865C31662F8F934E86FF01000A8C0367E58D3975285C3151488FD968375427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也会通过减少饭量\n来为锈蚀组做贡献的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F4F1A901A8FC751CF5C11996D91CF000A67654E3A950886807EC4505A8D21732E7684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个调查集结了锈蚀组全员之力，\n我会尽快让预算批下来的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A8C0367E596C67ED34E86950886807EC4516854584E4B529BFF0C000A62114F1A5C3D5FEB8BA998847B9762794E0B676576843002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们组里的那些人，\n就暂时由我自掏腰包来慰劳他们吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC7EC491CC768490A34E9B4EBAFF0C000A5C31668265F67531621181EA638F817053056765617052B34ED64EEC5427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n也给你一个特别奖励吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4E5F7ED94F604E004E2A7279522B595652B15427FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了另一种颜色的\n乌羽装扮西服套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E8653E64E0079CD989C82727684000A4E4C7FBD88C5626E897F670D595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说啊，在美发沙龙理发\n能模仿出我的发型。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF4554AFF0C57287F8E53D16C999F99740653D1000A80FD6A214EFF51FA6211768453D1578B300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "马斯卡托，\n要是让密阿雷变成更棒的城市，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大家自然就会聚集过来花钱了对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A6C65AF53616258FF0C000A8981662F8BA95BC6963F96F753D8621066F468D2768457CE5E02FF0C00100001BE00000A59275BB681EA71365C314F1A805A96C68FC7676582B194B14E865BF95427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说的正是。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为此我也希望能和锈蚀组\n构筑比现在更好的关系。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF476846B63662F300200100001BE01000A4E3A6B6462114E5F5E0C671B80FD548C950886807EC4000A67847B516BD473B0572866F4597D768451737CFB3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算从小住到大的城市变了，我还是喜欢！\n这里烙印着我的生存之道嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B974ECE5C0F4F4F52305927768457CE5E0253D84E86FF0C62118FD8662F559C6B22FF01000A8FD991CC70D95370774062117684751F5B584E4B9053561B300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一切都是为了报答这座城市\n接纳了曾是小混混的我们。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00520790FD662F4E3A4E8662A57B548FD95EA757CE5E02000A63A57EB34E8666FE662F5C0F6DF76DF7768462114EEC300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果说乌羽先生有自己的信念，\n那我也拥有自己的信念。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
